SET SYSMENU TO
SET SYSMENU AUTOMATIC

DEFINE PAD _7kt0ir7js OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Graph Transaction" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+G, ""
DEFINE PAD _7kt0ir7jt OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Report" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+R, ""
DEFINE PAD _7kt0ir7ju OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "S\<ystem Utilities" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+Y, ""
DEFINE PAD _7kt0ir7jv OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Exit" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+E, ""
ON PAD _7kt0ir7js OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP graphtrans
ON PAD _7kt0ir7jt OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP newitem
ON PAD _7kt0ir7ju OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP _4y80s2hh1
ON SELECTION PAD _7kt0ir7jv OF _MSYSMENU do endprg

DEFINE POPUP graphtrans MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Master Graph Entry/Edit/Delete"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Graph Register Entry/Edit/Delete"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Supplier Entry"
DEFINE BAR 4 OF graphtrans PROMPT "Carpet Size Entry"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF graphtrans do form grmainmaster
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF graphtrans do form grmainregistr
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF graphtrans do form grmainsupplier
ON SELECTION BAR 4 OF graphtrans do form casize

DEFINE POPUP newitem MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF newitem PROMPT "Graph Not Available/PO Wise All Match"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF newitem PROMPT "Supplier Issue - Receive Report"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF newitem PROMPT "Graph Stock in Hand"
ON BAR 1 OF newitem ACTIVATE POPUP graphnotav
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF newitem do form grsearchregissrevp
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF newitem do form grmainregistr

DEFINE POPUP graphnotav MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF graphnotav PROMPT "Graph Not Available for notdistri"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF graphnotav PROMPT "Powise All Match"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF graphnotav do form grnotndistri
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF graphnotav do form grordporep

DEFINE POPUP _4y80s2hh1 MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
